give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"The Passage of Time\"", "italic": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Shugenja", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing if your closest evil player is clockwise or anti-clockwise. If equidistant, this info is arbitrary."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pixie", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 1 in-play Townsfolk. If you were mad that you were this character, you gain their ability when they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "General", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn which alignment the Storyteller believes is winning: good, evil, or neither."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Snake Charmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: a chosen Demon swaps characters & alignments with you & is then poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Monk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player (not yourself): they are safe from the Demon tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Savant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, you may visit the Storyteller to learn 2 things in private: 1 is true & 1 is false."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Alsaahir", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, if you publicly guess which players are Minion(s) and which are Demon(s), good wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Engineer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose which Minions or which Demon is in play."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Huntsman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a living player: the Damsel, if chosen, becomes a not-in-play Townsfolk. [+the Damsel]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fisherman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, visit the Storyteller for some advice to help your team win."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Princess", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOn your 1st day, if you nominated & executed a player, the Demon doesn't kill tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cannibal", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have the ability of the recently killed executee. If they are evil, you are poisoned until a good player dies by execution."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Banshee", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf the Demon kills you, all players learn this. From now on, you may nominate twice per day and vote twice per nomination."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Plague Doctor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die, the Storyteller gains a Minion ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Barber", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Demon may choose 2 players (not another Demon) to swap characters."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mutant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you are \"mad\" about being an Outsider, you might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Damsel", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nAll Minions know a Damsel is in play. If a Minion publicly guesses you (once), your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Puzzlemaster", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n1 player is drunk, even if you die. If you guess (once) who it is, learn the Demon player, but guess wrong & get false info."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Psychopath", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach day, before nominations, you may publicly choose a player: they die. If executed, you only die if you lose roshambo."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Wizard", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nOnce per game, choose to make a wish. If granted, it might have a price & leave a clue as to its nature."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Boomdandy", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf you are executed, all but 3 players die. After a 10 to 1 countdown, the player with the most players pointing at them, dies."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Organ Grinder", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nAll players keep their eyes closed when voting and the vote tally is secret. Each night, choose if you are drunk until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Imp", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. If you kill yourself this way, a Minion becomes the Imp."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fang Gu", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. The 1st Outsider this kills becomes an evil Fang Gu & you die instead. [+1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Shabaloth", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose 2 players: they die. A dead player you chose last night might be regurgitated."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Harlot", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach night*, choose a living player: if they agree, you learn their character, but you both might die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Butcher", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach day, after the 1st execution, you may nominate again."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Gangster", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnce per day, you may choose to kill an alive neighbor, if your other alive neighbor agrees."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Voudon", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnly you & the dead can vote. They don't need a vote token to do so. A 50% majority isn't required."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sentinel", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nThere might be 1 extra or 1 fewer Outsider in play."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Djinn", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nUse the Djinn's special rule. All players know what it is. (Speak with Storyteller)"]],title:"The Passage of Time Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "The Passage of Time Script", "italic": false, "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"The Passage of Time\"", "italic": false, "color": "dark_green"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]